OL,3,GNEWSAMasters winner inspires next
OL,4,Ageneration of golfers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Masters champion has been in
OL,7,FGuernsey hoping to inspire the next
OL,8,Fgeneration of golfers.
OL,10,FDanny Willett, who became the second
OL,11,FEnglishman to claim the iconic Green
OL,12,FJacket in 2016, appeared at Guernsey's
OL,13,FGolf19 golf resort on Wednesday,
OL,14,Fhelping to inspire and support younger
OL,15,Fplayers.
OL,17,FSpeaking of his own experience as a
OL,18,Fyoungster, Willett said he "got very
OL,19,Ffortunate" because he enjoyed
OL,20,Fpracticing on his own on and was
OL,21,Fmotivated to see his results improve.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
